{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54468","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"审向道（京本作「彼将」），测（京本作「斥」，辛本作「情」）候要分明。\n莫爲时多蒙（辛本作「朦」）躁进（京本作「莫与兵徒萌躁进」），勿从刚暴速兼程，虑（京本作「虞」）彼伏潜兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}